OL,3,AGuinea-Bissau's military leaders delay
OL,4,Areturn to civilian rule until 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the presidency said an
OL,7,Fassessment of electoral preparations
OL,8,Fhad found that there were insufficient
OL,9,F"technical, material and financial
OL,10,Fconditions" to hold the polls as
OL,11,Fplanned.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
